  "criticalEvidence": [
    "AudioParallel.Stop26390 snapshots dictionary keys under Monitor/lock, gets actions by captured GUID, filters voice, Stop then Dictionary.Remove(loopIndex) @008cb3f7 using generic address3955208. This apparent original bug is preserved.",
    "AudioSequence26412 coerces only actionType2->1, starts while queue empty BEFORE Enqueue. OnEnd26403 dequeues unless stopping, sends AudioPlayEnd, then rechecks stopping and Peeks/Plays. Stop26413 dequeues all, skips source-null entries, invokes Destroy afterward.",
    "AudioSingle26414 creates using first ID or0, stores pending before stopping current; End26415 clears current before message and starts pending before clearing pending. Destroy26419 clears current only; pending remains.",
    "AudioActionBase.Play26271/MoveNext26284 captures native root before config lookup, stores data before root/data gate, nonpositive volume=>1 (NaN preserved), voice, await OnPlay virtualslot6, assigns source and invokes start only for native-nonnull source. No disposal generation/cancellation guard.",
    "AudioAction constructor26261 computes this.GetHashCode GUID then init26262 virtualAwake, AddUpdate, remove/add volume listener; Dispose26274 removes handle/reset0 then listener then virtual OnDispose then resource-unload/data-null. Failures preserve source partial writes."
  ],
